---
import InnerLayout from "../../layouts/InnerLayout.astro";
import Carousel from "../../components/Carousel.astro";
import Contact from "../../components/Contact.astro";
import Connect from "../../components/Connect.astro";
---

<InnerLayout>
  <section class="home service-details-home">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Cyber Security</h1>
      <p>
        Home / <a href="/service">Service</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <Carousel />
  <section class="sub-section">
    <div class="container">
      <!-- <div class="video-container">
        <video autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="/images/thumbnail.jpg">
          <source src="/videos/service.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
          Your browser does not support the HTML video tag.
        </video>
      </div> -->
      <h1>
        About <span>Cyber Security</span>
      </h1>
      <h2>CYBER SECURITY for Small and Medium-Sized Business</h2>
      <p>
        Sixty-one percent of data breaches happen to companies with fewer than
        1,000 employees. The financial impact of a data breach can cripple your
        company’s ability to operate. Data loss could lead to extended downtime
        when you can’t serve your customers and you may lose their trust in your
        business.
      </p>
      <p>
        Technical security is about protecting your network from intruders.
        Technical security uses tools such as next-generation firewalls and
        antivirus software to limit unauthorized access to your network, as well
        as detect and remove malware.
      </p>
      <p>
        No one company can fulfill all your business’s cyber security needs, but
        BIM can help you build a foundation for a strong cyber security policy.
      </p>
      <p>
        We will secure your network and advise your company’s C-suite of best
        security practices. We will regularly monitor your network for threats
        and maintain compliance standards. We may also implement standard
        policies such as multiple security technology and identity management.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <Contact />
  <Carousel />
  <Connect />
</InnerLayout>
